    section1Body: "We separate the groom's styling from the wider group so his look stays distinct in photographs, while family and baraatis receive a quicker, coordinated fold. Artists are assigned based on your final headcount, not a fixed package size.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "We confirm the final headcount close to the date, since guest numbers often shift — but the initial booking should still include your best estimate so we can plan artist numbers early.",
    section3Title: "Who usually books this",
